{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619950/extras/h.png?t=1744362242\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve your way out of a meticulously crafted diorama in this unique escape room experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619950/extras/room.png?t=1744362242\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619950/extras/h2.png?t=1744362242\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manipulate the glass box with intuitive click-and-drag controls, examine objects up close, and gather essential items to overcome challenging puzzles. Your objective: find the key and break free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619950/extras/room2.png?t=1744362242\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619950/extras/h3.png?t=1744362242\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A serene, concentration-inducing soundtrack accompanies your exploration, creating the perfect environment to solve puzzles and uncover the secrets within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619950/extras/room3.png?t=1744362242\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619950/extras/h4.png?t=1744362242\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In case you get stuck while trying to solve a riddle, click the bulb button to get a hint that will help you solve the puzzle you're stuck on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619950/extras/xslogo2.png?t=1744362242\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hi there, <strong>Frank Eno</strong>'s here, I have been creating escape room and puzzle games since 2020 under the name of\u00a0 <strong>XSGames</strong>, doing all by myself: code, graphics, music, design, concept, etc.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3619950?t=1744362242","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3619950?t=1744362242","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619950/3e02ccf3b2819fe8ac966003348ae9463aa9b428/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744362242","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619950/3e02ccf3b2819fe8ac966003348ae9463aa9b428/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744362242","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619950/extras/h.png?t=1744362242\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve your way out of a meticulously crafted diorama in this unique escape room experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619950/extras/room.png?t=1744362242\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i